In this MQL4 code, I have created an indicator that displays three LWMAs with different colors, calculates the difference between the highest and lowest values, and checks if the difference is less than a user-defined input value. If the MAs are within the specified range, a box is drawn around them, and when the price closes outside of this box, a "BREAKOUT" message is displayed, and a notification is sent to the mobile.

