4. Use transactions for bulk operations:
In the AddOrUpdateUser method, you are adding or updating multiple cards for a user. You can improve the performance of this operation by using a transaction to group all the queries into a single atomic operation. Here is an example of how to use transactions:

public async Task AddOrUpdateUserAsync(User user)
{
