In Rust, the `reqwest` crate provides a simple and convenient way to make HTTP requests, with support for various HTTP methods (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, etc.), request headers, request bodies, and more. Here is an example of a simple HTTP GET request using `reqwest`:

