the quiver appears randomly at a vertical position between 100px and 400px ,
its appearance takes place randomly: every 1.5s , there is a probability of 0.5 that a quiver will appear. If so, it replaces the previous quiver.
a quiver is destroyed if it collides with a bird,
when the bow collides with a quiver, its stock of arrows is renewed to 5.



