Now you just need to adjust the methods in the `SqLiteDatabase` class to use the appropriate sqlite-net-pcl methods to interact with the database. For example:

```csharp
public async Task<User> GetOrAddUserAsync(string userId)
{
    var user = await GetUserAsync(userId);
    if (user != null) return user;

    user = new User { Id = userId };
    await AddOrUpdateUserAsync(user);
    return user;
}

